  <div class="section-title">Step 6: For the Network name, enter <span data-field="network_name_input">{{ network_name_input }}</span>.</div>
  <div class="section-title">Step 8: For the Security type, select <span data-field="security_type_input">{{ security_type_input }}</span> from the dropdown box.</div>
  <div class="section-title">Step 9: For the Encryption type select <span data-field="encryption_type_input">{{ encryption_type_input }}</span>.</div>
  <div class="section-title">Step 10: Click the Next button.</div>
  
  <div class="screenshot-container" style="margin-top: 20px;">
