<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">Step 11: Click the "Security Tab".</div>
  <div class="screenshot-container">
    <img src="placeholder_screenshot_7.png" alt="Step 11 Screenshot" class="screenshot-img">
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Step 12: Click on "Settings" button.</div>
  <div class="screenshot-container">
    <img src="placeholder_screenshot_8.png" alt="Step 12 Screenshot" class="screenshot-img">
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Step 13: "Uncheck", the box for Validate server certificate</div>
  <div class="screenshot-container">
    <img src="placeholder_screenshot_9.png" alt="Step 13 Screenshot" class="screenshot-img">
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Step 14: "Click" on Configure button.</div>
  <div class="screenshot-container">
    <img src="placeholder_screenshot_10.png" alt="Step 14 Screenshot" class="screenshot-img">
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Step 15: "Uncheck" the box for Automatically use my windows logon name and password(and domain if any)</div>
  <div class="section-title">Step 16: "Click" on OK.</div>
  <div class="screenshot-container">
    <img src="placeholder_screenshot_11.png" alt="Step 15-16 Screenshot" class="screenshot-img">
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Step 17: "Click" on OK.</div>
  <div class="screenshot-container">
