<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Synthetic Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-label { flex-basis: 30%; }
  .form-input { flex-basis: 65%; }
  .checkbox-group label { margin-right: 15px; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Step 18: "Click" the Advanced Settings" button.</h2>
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">AirSuccess Wireless Network Properties</div>
      <span style="font-size: 1.2em;">&times;</span>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px;">
      <button style="padding: 5px 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; background-color: #f0f0f0;">Connection</button>
      <button style="padding: 5px 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; background-color: #e0e0e0;">Security</button>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">Security type:</div>
      <select style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
        <option>{{ security_type }}</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">Encryption type:</div>
      <select style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
        <option>{{ encryption_type }}</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">Choose a network authentication method:</div>
      <select style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
        <option>{{ authentication_method }}</option>
      </select>
      <button style="padding: 5px 10px; margin-left: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">Settings</button>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="remember_credentials" style="margin-right: 10px;">
      <label for="remember_credentials">Remember my credentials for this connection each time I'm logged on</label>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <button style="padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #0078d4; color: white; border: none;">Advanced settings</button>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 20px;">
      <button style="padding: 5px 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-right: 10px;">OK</button>
      <button style="padding: 5px 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">Cancel</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Step 19: "Uncheck", the box for Specify automation mode</h2>
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Advanced settings</div>
      <span style="font-size: 1.2em;">&times;</span>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">802.1X settings</div>
      <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <input type="checkbox" id="specify_auth" style="margin-right: 10px;">
        <label for="specify_auth">Specify authentication mode:</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">User or computer authentication</div>
      <select style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
        <option>{{ auth_mode }}</option>
      </select>
      <button style="padding: 5px 10px; margin-left: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">Save credentials</button>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="enable_single_signon" style="margin-right: 10px;">
      <label for="enable_single_signon">Enable single sign on for this network</label>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">Perform immediately before user logon</div>
      <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 10px;">
        <label>Perform immediately before user logon</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">Perform immediately after user logon</div>
      <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 10px;">
        <label>Perform immediately after user logon</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">Maximum delay (seconds):</div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
        <input type="number" value="{{ max_delay }}" style="width: 60px; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
        <span style="margin-left: 10px;">seconds</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="allow_dialogs" style="margin-right: 10px;">
      <label for="allow_dialogs">Allow additional dialogs to be displayed during single sign on</label>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="separate_lan" style="margin-right: 10px;">
      <label for="separate_lan">This network uses separate virtual LANs for machine and user authentication</label>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 20px;">
      <button style="padding: 5px 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-right: 10px;">OK</button>
      <button style="padding: 5px 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">Cancel</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Step 20: Click on the drop down arrow and choose "User authentication" the box for Specify automation mode</h2>
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Advanced settings</div>
      <span style="font-size: 1.2em;">&times;</span>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">802.1X settings</div>
      <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <input type="checkbox" id="specify_auth_2" style="margin-right: 10px;">
        <label for="specify_auth_2">Specify authentication mode:</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">User or computer authentication</div>
      <select style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
        <option>{{ auth_mode_2 }}</option>
      </select>
      <button style="padding: 5px 10px; margin-left: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">Save credentials</button>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="enable_single_signon_2" style="margin-right: 10px;">
      <label for="enable_single_signon_2">Enable single sign on for this network</label>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">Perform immediately before user logon</div>
      <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 10px;">
        <label>Perform immediately before user logon</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">Perform immediately after user logon</div>
      <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 10px;">
        <label>Perform immediately after user logon</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">Maximum delay (seconds):</div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
        <input type="number" value="{{ max_delay_2 }}" style="width: 60px; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
        <span style="margin-left: 10px;">seconds</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="allow_dialogs_2" style="margin-right: 10px;">
      <label for="allow_dialogs_2">Allow additional dialogs to be displayed during single sign on</label>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="separate_lan_2" style="margin-right: 10px;">
      <label for="separate_lan_2">This network uses separate virtual LANs for machine and user authentication</label>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 20px;">
      <button style="padding: 5px 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-right: 10px;">OK</button>
      <button style="padding: 5px 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">Cancel</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Step 21: "Click" on OK.</h2>
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Advanced settings</div>
      <span style="font-size: 1.2em;">&times;</span>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 20px;">
      <button style="padding: 5px 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-right: 10px;">OK</button>
      <button style="padding: 5px 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">Cancel</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Step 22: On the bottom right corner, "Left Click" on the wireless signal.</h2>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <img src="placeholder_wireless_signal.png" alt="Wireless Signal" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Step 23: "Click" the "Connect" button</h2>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <img src="placeholder_connection_menu.png" alt="Connection Menu" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Step 24: Type in your "Username & Password" (blackboard credentials). Then click the "OK" button. Example: Trojan Mascot V00123456 Vsu\Tmas3456</h2>
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Windows Security</div>
      <span style="font-size: 1.2em;">&times;</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Network Authentication</div>
      <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <label>Please enter user credentials</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">User name</div>
      <input type="text" style="width: 100%; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Password</div>
      <input type="password" style="width: 100%; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 20px;">
      <button style="padding: 5px 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-right: 10px;">OK</button>
      <button style="padding: 5px 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">Cancel</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Step 25: Once your credentials have been accepted, your computer should be successfully connected to AirSuccess.</h2>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <img src="placeholder_connection_success.png" alt="Connection Success" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <h3 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Congratulations!</h3>
    <p>You are now connected to AirSuccess!</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Serif', serif; text-align: center;">VSU Student Helpdesk Game System Wireless MAC Registration Form</h1>
  <p style="text-align: center;">Please fill out form</p>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Date:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="date_submitted">{{ date_submitted }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label">Phone Number:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Full Name (Print):</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label">Last</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="last_name">{{ last_name }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label">First</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="first_name">{{ first_name }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label">MI</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="middle_initial">{{ middle_initial }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label">Suffix</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="suffix">{{ suffix }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Building/Residence Hall:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="building_hall">{{ building_hall }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label">Room:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="room_number">{{ room_number }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Type of Equipment:</div>
  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="margin-right: 20px;"><input type="checkbox" id="xbox" style="margin-right: 5px;"><label for="xbox">Xbox</label></div>
    <div style="margin-right: 20px;"><input type="checkbox" id="xbox360" style="margin-right: 5px;"><label for="xbox360">Xbox 360</label></div>
    <div style="margin-right: 20px;"><input type="checkbox" id="xbox360e" style="margin-right: 5px;"><label for="xbox360e">XBOX 360 Elite</label></div>
    <div style="margin-right: 20px;"><input type="checkbox" id="xboxone" style="margin-right: 5px;"><label for="xboxone">Xbox One</label></div>
    <div style="margin-right: 20px;"><input type="checkbox" id="ps2" style="margin-right: 5px;"><label for="ps2">PS2</label></div>
    <div style="margin-right: 20px;"><input type="checkbox" id="ps3" style="margin-right: 5px;"><label for="ps3">PS3</label></div>
    <div style="margin-right: 20px;"><input type="checkbox" id="ps4" style="margin-right: 5px;"><label for="ps4">PS4</label></div>
    <div style="margin-right: 20px;"><input type="checkbox" id="television" style="margin-right: 5px;"><label for="television">Television (This Include ROKU And Apple TV)</label></div>
    <div style="margin-right: 20px;"><input type="checkbox" id="wii" style="margin-right: 5px;"><label for="wii">Wii</label></div>
    <div style="margin-right: 20px;"><input type="checkbox" id="wiiu" style="margin-right: 5px;"><label for="wiiu">Wii U</label></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">Wireless MAC address:</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="wireless_mac_address">{{ wireless_mac_address }}</span></div>
    <p style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 5px;">The MAC Address may be displayed in the form of OO:OO:OO:OO:OO:OO</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">Student Email:</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="student_email">{{ student_email }}</span></div>
    <p style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 5px;">WEP Key will not be sent to personal emails. Student E-mail Address Required!</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">Requestor's Signature:</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="requestor_signature">{{ requestor_signature }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Date:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="submission_date">{{ submission_date }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">&bull; Both wired, wireless routers and switching devices are not permitted to be connected to the Virginia State University Network. Such Devices will be disabled once discovered.</p>
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">&bull; The wireless network uses WEP security. Once your request has been processed and approved you will be issued the required WEP key to access the AirGames Access Point (AP)</p>
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">&bull; The key will only work for the ENTIRE school year. You will be given ONE WEP KEY for multiple gaming consoles (only one console can be connected to the Internet at a given time)</p>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 0.8em;">Rev. VSU Student ServiceDesk 01/15</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>